      "timestamp": "2026-11-20T02:54:17Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The one-byte overflow is in asn1_expand_octet_string(), which libtasn1 never calls itself and which upstream says is reached only when a program calls it explicitly. The only shipped consumer of libtasn1.so.6 is libgnutls.so.30, and no ELF file in these images imports asn1_expand_octet_string (nm -D)."
    },
