      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The vulnerable function mbedtls_x509_string_to_names() belongs to Mbed TLS's X.509 library (libmbedx509), which these images do not install; they ship only libmbedcrypto7, whose /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libmbedcrypto.so.2.28.3 neither exports nor references that function (nm -D)."
