      "status": "not_affected",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-20T02:54:18Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The use-after-free needs an application that sets CURLOPT_STREAM_DEPENDS and then calls curl_easy_reset(). libcurl never calls curl_easy_reset() itself, the curl CLI never sets CURLOPT_STREAM_DEPENDS, and no ELF file in the image (the only libcurl consumers are /usr/bin/curl and git's http helpers) imports curl_easy_reset (nm -D)."
    },
