      "timestamp": "2026-11-20T02:54:18Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The use-after-free needs HTTP/2 server push, which libcurl enables only when the application installs CURLMOPT_PUSHFUNCTION (otherwise it sends SETTINGS_ENABLE_PUSH=0 and denies every PUSH_PROMISE). The image's only libcurl consumers, /usr/bin/curl and git's http helpers, never set it: the curl CLI source has no PUSHFUNCTION and git does not import curl_multi_setopt."
    },
